{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(num: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given number is a Woodall number.\n    A Woodall number is defined by the formula n * 2^n - 1 for some non-negative integer n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if num < -1:\n        return False\n\n    if num == -1:  # W_0 = 0 * 2^0 - 1 = -1\n        return True\n\n    n = 1\n    while True:\n        woodall_candidate = n * (2**n) - 1\n        if woodall_candidate == num:\n            return True\n        elif woodall_candidate > num:\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
