{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "def is_Diff(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a given integer is divisible by 11 using the alternating sum of its digits.\n    Returns True if the alternating sum is divisible by 11, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    s = str(number)\n    alternating_sum = 0\n    sign = 1\n    for i in range(len(s) - 1, -1, -1):\n        digit = int(s[i])\n        alternating_sum += sign * digit\n        sign *= -1\n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0"}
