{"task_id": "Mbpp/255", "solution": "def combinations_colors(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates all combinations with repetition of elements from the input list,\n    each combination having a length equal to n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        return []\n    if n == 0:\n        return [()]\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    result = []\n    def generate(current_combination, k):\n        if k == n:\n            result.append(tuple(current_combination))\n            return\n\n        for element in input_list:\n            current_combination.append(element)\n            generate(current_combination, k + 1)\n            current_combination.pop()\n\n    generate([], 0)\n    return result"}
