{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(input_list, n):\n    \"\"\"Splits an input list into 'n' sublists based on element index modulo 'n'.\n    Elements are distributed into sublists based on their original index (i % n).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return []\n\n    output_lists = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n\n    for i, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        target_sublist_index = i % n\n        output_lists[target_sublist_index].append(element)\n\n    return output_lists"}
