{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of binomial coefficients C(n, k) for even indices k.\n    This function computes C(n, k) for k = 0, 2, 4, ... up to n and sums them.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n_val: int, k_val: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n_val, k_val) efficiently.\"\"\"\n        if k_val < 0 or k_val > n_val:\n            return 0\n        if k_val == 0 or k_val == n_val:\n            return 1\n        if k_val > n_val // 2:  # Apply symmetry: C(n, k) = C(n, n-k)\n            k_val = n_val - k_val\n\n        res = 1\n        for i in range(k_val):\n            res = res * (n_val - i) // (i + 1)\n        return res\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate through even indices from 0 up to n (inclusive)\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n\n    return total_sum"}
