{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def _count_digit_frequencies(number: int) -> dict[int, int]:\n    \"\"\"Counts the occurrences of each digit in a given integer.\"\"\"\n    digit_frequencies = {}\n    for char_digit in str(number):\n        digit = int(char_digit)\n        digit_frequencies[digit] = digit_frequencies.get(digit, 0) + 1\n    return digit_frequencies\ndef validate(integer_value: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\"\"\"\n    frequencies = _count_digit_frequencies(integer_value)\n\n    for digit, frequency in frequencies.items():\n        if digit == 0 and frequency > 0:\n            return False\n        if frequency > digit:\n            return False\n    return True"}
