{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n'th Lucas number using its recursive definition.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        return find_lucas(n - 1) + find_lucas(n - 2)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/395", "solution": "def first_non_repeating_character(input_string: str) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"Finds the first non-repeated character in a given string.\n\n    It uses a frequency map to count occurrences and then iterates through the string to find the first character with a count of one.\n    \"\"\"\n    char_counts = {}\n    for char in input_string:\n        char_counts[char] = char_counts.get(char, 0) + 1\n\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char_counts[char] == 1:\n            return char\n\n    return None"}
