{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(number_list: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits of each number in the given list and returns their total sum.\n    It handles numbers by taking their absolute value to calculate digit sums.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_aggregated_sum = 0\n    for number in number_list:\n        individual_sum = 0\n        current_number = abs(number)\n\n        while current_number > 0:\n            digit = current_number % 10\n            individual_sum += digit\n            current_number //= 10\n        total_aggregated_sum += individual_sum\n    return total_aggregated_sum"}
