{"task_id": "Mbpp/412", "solution": "def _is_odd(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Determines if a given integer is odd.\"\"\"\n    return number % 2 != 0\ndef remove_odd(numbers: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes odd numbers from a given list of integers.\n    Returns a new list containing only the even numbers, preserving their relative order.\n    \"\"\"\n    even_numbers = []\n    for number in numbers:\n        if not _is_odd(number):\n            even_numbers.append(number)\n    return even_numbers"}
