{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(arr: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of comparable elements using the Shell Sort algorithm and returns a new sorted list.\"\"\"\n    n_arr = list(arr) # Create a mutable copy of the input list\n    n = len(n_arr)\n\n    gap = n // 2\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = n_arr[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and n_arr[j - gap] > temp:\n                n_arr[j] = n_arr[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            n_arr[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return n_arr"}
