{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors of a given integer.\n    It iterates through potential factors, checking for divisibility and evenness.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, number + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:  # Check if i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:   # Check if i is even\n                total_sum += i\n    return total_sum"}
