{"task_id": "Mbpp/573", "solution": "def unique_product(numbers_list: list) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the product of unique numbers in a given list.\n    Returns 1.0 for an empty list or if no unique numbers are identified.\"\"\"\n    if not numbers_list:\n        return 1.0\n\n    unique_elements = set(numbers_list)\n    product = 1.0\n    for num in unique_elements:\n        product *= num\n    return product"}
