{"task_id": "Mbpp/579", "solution": "def find_dissimilar(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds dissimilar elements between two tuples.\n    An element is considered dissimilar if it is present in one input tuple\n    but not in the other.\n    \"\"\"\n    set_tuple1 = set(tuple1)\n    set_tuple2 = set(tuple2)\n    \n    result_elements_list = []\n    \n    # Identify elements unique to tuple1, preserving their order\n    for element in tuple1:\n        if element not in set_tuple2:\n            result_elements_list.append(element)\n            \n    # Identify elements unique to tuple2, preserving their order\n    for element in tuple2:\n        if element not in set_tuple1:\n            result_elements_list.append(element)\n            \n    return tuple(result_elements_list)"}
