{"task_id": "Mbpp/616", "solution": "def tuple_modulo(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs element-wise modulo on two tuples of the same length.\n    Raises ValueError if tuples have different lengths.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple1) != len(tuple2):\n        raise ValueError(\"Tuples must be of the same length\")\n\n    result = []\n    for a, b in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        result.append(a % b)\n\n    return tuple(result)"}
