{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers_list, n):\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    # Iterate through all unique pairs of numbers (i, j) where i < j.\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            num1 = numbers_list[i]\n            num2 = numbers_list[j]\n            # Add the XOR of the pair to the total sum if the numbers are distinct.\n            if num1 != num2:\n                total_xor_sum += (num1 ^ num2)\n    return total_xor_sum"}
