{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(input_list: list, num_rotations: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a given list to the right by a specified number of items.\n    Returns a new list with elements rotated 'num_rotations' times to the right.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    list_length = len(input_list)\n    actual_rotations = num_rotations % list_length\n\n    if actual_rotations == 0:\n        return list(input_list)\n\n    return input_list[-actual_rotations:] + input_list[:-actual_rotations]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "class Number:\n    def __init__(self, value: int):\n        self._value = value\n        self._digits = self._extract_digits()\n\n    def _extract_digits(self) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Determines the individual digits of the number.\"\"\"\n        if self._value == 0:\n            return [0]\n        digits = []\n        temp_value = abs(self._value)\n        while temp_value > 0:\n            digits.append(temp_value % 10)\n            temp_value //= 10\n        return digits[::-1]\n\n    def contains_zero(self) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if the number contains the digit '0'.\"\"\"\n        return 0 in self._digits\n\n    def is_divisible_by_all_digits(self) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Verifies if the number is perfectly divisible by each of its individual non-zero digits.\"\"\"\n        for digit in self._digits:\n            if digit == 0:\n                return False\n            if self._value % digit != 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    def is_valid(self) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Combines checks for zero and divisibility to determine overall validity.\"\"\"\n        if self.contains_zero():\n            return False\n        return self.is_divisible_by_all_digits()\ndef divisible_by_digits(startnum: int, endnum: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a given range (inclusive) where every number is divisible by every digit it contains.\n    Numbers containing '0' are excluded.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for num_value in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        number = Number(num_value)\n        if number.is_valid():\n            result.append(num_value)\n    return result"}
